  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the ttukbaegi earthenware pot in a preheated oven at 180°C for 10 minutes.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the ground beef, onion, garlic, parsley, salt, and black pepper. Mix well.",
    "Add the breadcrumbs, egg, and mix until just combined.",
    "Cut the burrata cheese into small pieces and add to the bowl. Mix until just combined.",
    "Shape the mixture into small cylindrical shapes, about 5cm in diameter and 7cm in length.",
    "Place the shaped mixture into the preheated ttukbaegi earthenware pot and cover with a lid.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven at 180°C for 15 minutes.",
    "Remove the pot from the oven and let it cool for 5 minutes.",
    "Use a spoon to scoop out the molten cheese and serve hot.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
    "This dish can be served as a snack or appetizer."
  ],
